{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S09\",\"screen\":\"像又遇见当初不知所措的自己，走过这一路问题还是没答案\",\"source\":\"最初的问题又浮上来，却没有因此得到一个简单的答案。\",\"type\":\"8\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿说的是没有得到一个简单的答案，仍可能存在复杂的答案；屏幕稿改成完全没有答案，语义更绝对。\"},{\"sec\":\"S12\",\"screen\":\"想起好时候还是会心软、也怕一个人熬，却仍能决定自己怎么站立\",\"source\":\"即使知道自己会犹疑、疲惫、想念，仍然可以决定怎样站立。\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"严重\",\"why\":\"定稿没有害怕独自熬下去这一心理，屏幕稿新增了对孤独的恐惧，改变了人物当下的内心内容。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "04aa9f67-5551-493b-ab1a-0def365a2abc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T063119328856Z", "elapsed_seconds": 627.609, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T06:41:46.940481+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "65120f3dea82657e175f4046925a233210370827f583eb5578c261129445433e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedf